---
// 首页「关于此间」：文案 + 墨环竹影插画 + 山窗小记印章。样式自 index.astro 平移（scoped）。
---

<section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="shell about-grid">
    <div class="about-copy reveal">
      <p class="section-kicker" data-font-role="hand">ABOUT THIS PLACE</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="about-title" data-font-role="cal">关于此间</h2>
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>我喜欢记录日常，也喜欢山川与旧书。</p>
        <p>这个网站会保存沿途所见、读书所得，以及一些没有明确分类的想法。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-signature">愿每一页都有来处</div>
      <div class="about-topics" aria-label="长期记录主题">
        <span>代码</span>
        <span>器物</span>
        <span>光影</span>
        <span>山川</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ink-orbit reveal" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="ink-circle"></div>
      <svg class="bamboo" viewBox="0 0 340 340" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <g fill="none" stroke="#586258" stroke-linecap="round">
          <path d="M108 294C131 236 151 177 173 78" stroke-width="5" opacity=".72" />
          <path d="M170 93C204 111 228 135 250 168" stroke-width="2.7" opacity=".58" />
          <path d="M148 170C114 153 90 132 70 101" stroke-width="2.5" opacity=".5" />
          <path d="M129 226C160 218 187 221 215 236" stroke-width="2.4" opacity=".5" />
          <path d="M116 267C92 254 74 237 59 214" stroke-width="2.1" opacity=".42" />
        </g>
        <g fill="#586258">
          <ellipse cx="218" cy="125" rx="9" ry="32" transform="rotate(-42 218 125)" opacity=".44" />
          <ellipse cx="246" cy="160" rx="8" ry="28" transform="rotate(-30 246 160)" opacity=".37" />
          <ellipse cx="98" cy="132" rx="9" ry="33" transform="rotate(43 98 132)" opacity=".39" />
          <ellipse cx="70" cy="101" rx="8" ry="28" transform="rotate(38 70 101)" opacity=".31" />
          <ellipse cx="181" cy="224" rx="9" ry="33" transform="rotate(-74 181 224)" opacity=".39" />
          <ellipse cx="212" cy="235" rx="8" ry="28" transform="rotate(-63 212 235)" opacity=".32" />
          <ellipse cx="87" cy="252" rx="8" ry="28" transform="rotate(51 87 252)" opacity=".32" />
          <ellipse cx="59" cy="215" rx="7" ry="25" transform="rotate(42 59 215)" opacity=".26" />
        </g>
        <g stroke="#f2eee3" stroke-width="1.6" opacity=".42">
          <path d="M148 169l14 4" />
          <path d="M160 126l14 4" />
          <path d="M132 219l13 4" />
        </g>
      </svg>
      <div class="about-seal" data-font-role="cal">山窗<br />小记</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.28), transparent 48%),
      var(--paper);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(380px, 0.72fr);
    gap: clamp(54px, 9vw, 130px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-text {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-top: 34px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 2.15;
  }

  .about-text p {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .about-signature {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 7px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(164,68,52,0.45);
    color: var(--moss-deep);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  .about-topics {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px 28px;
    margin-top: 34px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  .about-topics span::before {
    content: "·";
    margin-right: 8px;
    color: var(--cinnabar);
  }

  .ink-orbit {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 510px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .ink-circle {
    position: absolute;
    width: min(38vw, 430px);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 12px solid transparent;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 51% 49%, var(--paper) 0 57%, transparent 58%),
      conic-gradient(from 12deg,
        rgba(44,48,44,0.82),
        rgba(63,70,64,0.4) 12%,
        rgba(44,48,44,0.78) 22%,
        rgba(63,70,64,0.22) 36%,
        rgba(44,48,44,0.72) 52%,
        rgba(63,70,64,0.28) 66%,
        rgba(44,48,44,0.84) 82%,
        rgba(63,70,64,0.3));
    filter: blur(0.35px);
    opacity: 0.72;
    transform: rotate(-12deg) scaleX(1.02);
    -webkit-mask: radial-gradient(circle, transparent 0 56%, #000 57% 66%, transparent 67%);
    mask: radial-gradient(circle, transparent 0 56%, #000 57% 66%, transparent 67%);
  }

  .ink-circle::before,
  .ink-circle::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(46, 51, 47, 0.16);
    filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .ink-circle::before {
    width: 42px;
    height: 20px;
    left: -6px;
    top: 52%;
    transform: rotate(-20deg);
  }

  .ink-circle::after {
    width: 30px;
    height: 14px;
    right: 8px;
    bottom: 20%;
    transform: rotate(18deg);
  }

  .bamboo {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: min(31vw, 350px);
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .about-seal {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 4;
    right: 11%;
    bottom: 13%;
    width: 58px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: #f8eee4;
    background: rgba(164,68,52,0.9);
    border: 1px solid var(--cinnabar-deep);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    text-align: center;
    transform: rotate(4deg);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.13);
  }

  /* ≥821px：home-layout 网格语境下的归属与覆盖 */
  @media (min-width: 821px) {
    :global(.home-layout) > .about {
      grid-area: about;
    }

    :global(.home-layout) .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    :global(.home-layout) .ink-orbit {
      min-height: 300px;
    }

    :global(.home-layout) .ink-circle {
      width: min(100%, 240px);
    }

    :global(.home-layout) .bamboo {
      width: min(82%, 210px);
    }
  }

  /* ============ 夜色覆盖 ============ */
  :global(html[data-theme='night']) .about {
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(233, 226, 208, 0.05), transparent 48%),
      var(--paper);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme='night']) .ink-circle {
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 51% 49%, var(--paper) 0 57%, transparent 58%),
      conic-gradient(from 12deg,
        rgba(233, 226, 208, 0.7),
        rgba(163, 155, 133, 0.35) 12%,
        rgba(233, 226, 208, 0.66) 22%,
        rgba(163, 155, 133, 0.2) 36%,
        rgba(233, 226, 208, 0.62) 52%,
        rgba(163, 155, 133, 0.24) 66%,
        rgba(233, 226, 208, 0.72) 82%,
        rgba(163, 155, 133, 0.26));
  }

  :global(html[data-theme='night']) .ink-circle::before,
  :global(html[data-theme='night']) .ink-circle::after {
    background: rgba(233, 226, 208, 0.14);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme='night']) .bamboo {
    filter: brightness(1.65);
  }

  /* ============ 响应式 ============ */
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ink-orbit {
      min-height: 420px;
    }

    .ink-circle {
      width: min(62vw, 390px);
    }

    .bamboo {
      width: min(48vw, 320px);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .ink-orbit {
      min-height: 340px;
    }

    .ink-circle {
      width: min(84vw, 340px);
    }

    .bamboo {
      width: min(65vw, 280px);
    }

    .about-seal {
      right: 8%;
      bottom: 8%;
      width: 50px;
    }
  }
</style>
